Abstract = {This paper discusses how to carry out eco-transition in China coastal
   development area. This is an important and urgent issue of urban
   sustainable development that industrial parks into eco-industrial parks.
   It is a tactic selection to realize development area's sustainable
   development that boost present industrial system to industrial
   eco-system and then build eco-industry parks. It is thinks that the
   region coastal development zones should choose the cycle mode which the
   three level of industry, Cluster-Industry and Eco-Industrial Parks
   developed corporately, that is, promoting clean production continually
   and cutting pollution from the source in the aspect of enterprise 12,
   and building up the ecosystem industrial chain and then form industrial
   community according to the product integration, industrial integration,
   material integration and technique integration in the aspect of
   industry, and in the aspect of society attaching great importance to the
