Abstract = {Initial value of the networks weight vector can contain a large amount
   of information One of possibilities to use this information is to
   utilise a weighted combination of initial and final values of the
   weights An alternative is the early stopping. To utilise an information
   contained in the initial weight vector (w) over cap(0) one needs to know
   accuracy of determination of (w) over cap(0) and (w) over cap(1), a
   final weight An analytical expressions of an optimal weighting factor
   severely depend on the parameter estimation schema as well as on the
   learning-set sire Utilisation of the additional validation-set is a
