Abstract = {The purpose of this chapter is to examine the changes in livestock
   management and grassland condition that have taken place in Sunan Yugur
   Autonomous County, Gansu Province, over the past 2 decades. Household
   surveys were used to assess the current financial situation (income and
   expenditure) and interviews with herders shed light on their livestock
   management practices. The objective was to better understand the causes
   of degradation in this region and why herders continue to over graze
   their rangeland resources.},
