   Paulo, the largest urban environment located in the subtropical region
   of Brazil. This description is based on measurements of global and
   diffuse solar radiation carried out during 5.25 years, in an
   experimental site located in the City of S (a) over tildeo Paulo,
   Brazil. The annual evolution of amplitude of the diurnal cycle indicated
   a seasonal pattern with two distinct periods: Fall-Winter and
   Spring-Summer.},
