   Sci Romanian Acad},
Abstract = {Autism spectrum disorder (ASD) affects countless individuals worldwide,
   both young and old, with significant impacts on education, mental
   health, and social well-being. Early intervention is vital, and recent
   research offers valuable insights into the global prevalence of ASD. To
   complement traditional autism therapies, a novel therapeutic approach
   uses digital games developed with Makey Makey and Scratch. These games
   aim to improve cognitive skills in children with ASD and explore
   emotional narratives through two unique modes of play. This approach
   emphasizes progress monitoring, providing personalized and engaging
   interventions.},
