   Engineering (ICCAHE 2013), Zhuhai, PEOPLES R CHINA, JUL 27-28, 2013},
Abstract = {This paper discussed the influence of the urban rail transport on land
   use and spatial development of the station zone. This research
   investigated the land use and real estate prices of the Nanjing Metro
   Line 2 Jiqingmen Station zone, and analyzed land use of station zone and
   how it was changed in different distances to rail station. The research
   shows that the overall land use and land prices of rail transit zone
   have spatial circle characteristics. As the land away from the rail
   transit site, the influence to the land-use and land prices form the
   station gradually decline. At the same time, in the level of the urban
   morphology, rail station produce significant leading role in the
   building form development around the site.},
