   Philadelphia, PA, JUL 30-31, 2014},
Abstract = {This chapter examines EI, presents a history of EI including the various
   models, and a discussion of the three streams approach to classifying EI
   literature. The author advocates for the efficacy of the Stream One
   Ability Model (SOAM) of EI citing previous authors and literature. The
   commonly used SOAM instruments are discussed in light of recent studies.
   The discussion turns to alternate tests of the SOAM of EI including
   Situational Judgment Tests ( SJTs). Recommendations include an analysis
   of SOAM instruments, a new approach to measurement, and increased use of
   SJTs to capture the four-branch ability model of EI.},
