Abstract = {Floods through the eyes of the inhabitants deal with floods over time in
   two selected localities and the research is focused on the view of local
   population. It describes the specific situation in the village
   Moravicany and the town of Olomouc. The monitored municipalities were
   affected by floods repeatedly, the worst in 1997. Since this critical
   year, various flood control measures have been implemented to protect
   the municipalities from overflowing water and it is interesting to see
   the awareness of the local population today, in the context of the
   changes that have already been made. Many of these flood control
   measures are used recreationally and they increase the attractiveness of
   the areas.},
