   decision-making with grey situation. the urban land use dynamic change
   model is constructed based on decision-making with gray situation and
   hierarchical method as well as CA, in which the hierarchical method is
   used for dealing with the importance of among objects and factors. The
   arable land is used as constraint factor for transformation rules in the
   model, Lastly, the model has been tested by taking Qionghai city of
   Hainan province as an example, the result shows that the model is valid
