Abstract = {The urban drainage network is the most important part of the urban
   drainage facilities. The current situation monitoring of the drainage
   pipe network is carried out, the existing problems are found, the causes
   of the problems are analyzed and the pertinent suggestions are proposed.
   A sustained, stable and safe operation of drainage network can effective
   and efficient to prevent water environment from increasing
   deterioration, help to control black and odorous water, and improve the
   water environment. Based on the monitoring work of drainage network in a
   city of northern China, this paper discusses the monitoring and
   vulnerability analysis of pipeline network.},
